{"reviewId": "1137090_8b87EkOwz", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 18, "content": "“战略机遇”，就是在美元走强、全球资产价格承压时，利用中国积累的外汇储备，大规模、低成本地收购海外战略性资产（资源、技术、企业），并推动人民币国际化，从而在未来的国际货币体系和资源分配中占据更有利的位置。 但由于2005年7月人民币汇改后升值，吸引了大量热钱流入，导致中国不仅没有成为全球资本的“蓄水池”，反而成了全球资本流入的主要目的地，从而错失了这一以低成本置换海外资产的窗口期。\n个人存疑的是，以05年的国力，就算收购海外战略性资产，是否能守住也是个未知数吧", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "人民币始终是美元的潜在威胁。2005年7月人民币一次汇改，人民币兑美元升值使中国错失了那一次战略机遇，没有抓住中长期美元资产空出的蓄水池机会，美国得以从金融危机中全身而退。", "range": "33203-33289", "chapterName": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "chapterIdx": 18, "reviewId": "1137090_8b87EkOwz", "userVid": 1137090, "topics": [], "createTime": 1785920016, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "author": {"userVid": 1137090, "name": "兔子骑士团🧐", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DtngvclQ4KB2iaz0fLAJW3CgSazkuxYI1pPvF2OjSeT4xrB8vmABO1xxpPxI8ibrqTevgELWAtKictbzQ9uxk2icIMnTnnXR9iatX1CFyQsfLq64/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "兔子骑士团🧐", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-2000", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 2000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 2, "likes": [{"userVid": 545915395, "name": "超超", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0002-KCu5_vzga~FNxeWDaCxnQe8/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "超超", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240805-25", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "狂暴阅读周", "levelIndex": 25}}], "commentsCou